
<h4 class="mt-4">Start Here</h4>
<div class="row mt-2">
    <div class="col-12">
        <h5>Waking Resources</h5>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="row mt-1">
    <div class="col-10 offset-1">
        <p>
            For the best experience, ensure all resources are awake by clicking on the 'API Resource Status' tab and clicking ping all. Pinging resources does not require login.
            The projects are hosted on several Basic Service Plans. The Consumer client can similarly be pinged and also accessed from the 'Consumer Client App' tab.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

