        <p>
            The Product Management page allows adding product images and documents to Azure Blob Storage. Additional page selections display Product Write Side API data collections, to include
            Event Store records, Outbox records, and any generated snapshots (generated at version increments of 10).
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="row mt-2">
